{"seq":1,"slug":"continuous-monitoring","title":"持续监控与行为分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/continuous-monitoring","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"持续监控与行为分析\">持续监控与行为分析</h1><p>零信任的&quot;持续验证&quot;不仅在访问决策时发生——整个会话生命周期内，系统必须持续监控用户和实体的行为，检测偏离基线的异常并即时响应。这种闭环持续验证（Continuous Verification Loop）是零信任与传统安全的本质区别：传统模型在认证后&quot;放行并遗忘&quot;，零信任则&quot;放行但持续观察&quot;。用户实体行为分析（UEBA）和安全编排自动化响应（SOAR）是实现这一闭环的核心技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 数据采集层&#10;        LOG[访问日志]&#10;        NET[网络流量]&#10;        EDR_S[端点遥测]&#10;        CLOUD[云审计日志]&#10;        IDP_L[IdP 认证事件]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 分析层&#10;        NORM[日志标准化 SIEM]&#10;        UEBA_E[UEBA 引擎]&#10;        THREAT[威胁检测模型]&#10;        CORR[事件关联]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 响应层&#10;        ALERT[告警生成]&#10;        SOAR_E[SOAR 编排]&#10;        PE_FB[策略引擎反馈]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 执行层&#10;        REVOKE[会话撤销]&#10;        STEP[步进验证]&#10;        ISOLATE[设备隔离]&#10;        BLOCK[IP/账户封禁]&#10;    end&#10;    LOG --&gt; NORM&#10;    NET --&gt; NORM&#10;    EDR_S --&gt; NORM&#10;    CLOUD --&gt; NORM&#10;    IDP_L --&gt; NORM&#10;    NORM --&gt; UEBA_E&#10;    NORM --&gt; THREAT&#10;    UEBA_E --&gt; CORR&#10;    THREAT --&gt; CORR&#10;    CORR --&gt; ALERT&#10;    ALERT --&gt; SOAR_E&#10;    SOAR_E --&gt; PE_FB&#10;    PE_FB --&gt; REVOKE&#10;    PE_FB --&gt; STEP&#10;    PE_FB --&gt; ISOLATE&#10;    PE_FB --&gt; BLOCK\">graph TD\n    subgraph 数据采集层\n        LOG[访问日志]\n        NET[网络流量]\n        EDR_S[端点遥测]\n        CLOUD[云审计日志]\n        IDP_L[IdP 认证事件]\n    end\n    subgraph 分析层\n        NORM[日志标准化 SIEM]\n        UEBA_E[UEBA 引擎]\n        THREAT[威胁检测模型]\n        CORR[事件关联]\n    end\n    subgraph 响应层\n        ALERT[告警生成]\n        SOAR_E[SOAR 编排]\n        PE_FB[策略引擎反馈]\n    end\n    subgraph 执行层\n        REVOKE[会话撤销]\n        STEP[步进验证]\n        ISOLATE[设备隔离]\n        BLOCK[IP/账户封禁]\n    end\n    LOG --&gt; NORM\n    NET --&gt; NORM\n    EDR_S --&gt; NORM\n    CLOUD --&gt; NORM\n    IDP_L --&gt; NORM\n    NORM --&gt; UEBA_E\n    NORM --&gt; THREAT\n    UEBA_E --&gt; CORR\n    THREAT --&gt; CORR\n    CORR --&gt; ALERT\n    ALERT --&gt; SOAR_E\n    SOAR_E --&gt; PE_FB\n    PE_FB --&gt; REVOKE\n    PE_FB --&gt; STEP\n    PE_FB --&gt; ISOLATE\n    PE_FB --&gt; BLOCK</pre><p>闭环的关键特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>实时性</strong>：从异常检测到响应执行的延迟目标 &lt; 30 秒</li>\n<li><strong>自动化</strong>：高置信度异常触发自动响应（无需 SOC 人工干预）</li>\n<li><strong>策略反馈</strong>：检测结果直接更新策略引擎的风险评分，影响后续所有访问决策</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ueba-行为基线建模\">UEBA 行为基线建模</h2><p>用户实体行为分析（User and Entity Behavior Analytics）通过机器学习为每个用户/实体建立&quot;正常行为基线&quot;，偏离基线的行为被标记为潜在风险：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行为维度</th>\n<th>基线特征</th>\n<th>异常信号</th>\n<th>风险级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>登录地理</td>\n<td>常在北京/上海</td>\n<td>突然从尼日利亚登录</td>\n<td>高——不可能旅行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活跃时段</td>\n<td>工作日 9:00-18:00</td>\n<td>凌晨 3:00 大量操作</td>\n<td>中——可能被盗用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据访问量</td>\n<td>日均下载 50 文件</td>\n<td>一小时下载 5000 文件</td>\n<td>高——数据外泄指征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限使用</td>\n<td>仅访问本部门资源</td>\n<td>突然访问财务/HR 系统</td>\n<td>中——横向探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证模式</td>\n<td>总是通过 MFA</td>\n<td>MFA 被跳过/降级</td>\n<td>高——可能绕过控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 调用</td>\n<td>固定调用模式</td>\n<td>枚举式遍历 API</td>\n<td>高——自动化攻击</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>不可能旅行（Impossible Travel）检测</strong>是 UEBA 最经典的用例：如果一个用户 10 分钟前在北京认证，现在又从纽约发起请求，物理上不可能——这几乎确定是凭证被盗用。</p>\n<p><strong>基线建模方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统计基线</strong>：计算每个维度的均值和标准差，超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu + 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 标记为异常</li>\n<li><strong>时间序列模型</strong>：捕捉周期性模式（如每周一早上的登录高峰）</li>\n<li><strong>对等组比较</strong>：将用户行为与同角色/同部门同事对比，发现个体异常</li>\n<li><strong>图分析</strong>：构建用户-资源-设备的访问图，检测异常的新边（从未见过的访问路径）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"威胁检测与信号关联\">威胁检测与信号关联</h2><p>单一信号的置信度往往不足以触发响应——需要多信号关联提升检测精度：</p>\n<p><strong>关联规则示例</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关联模式</th>\n<th>组合信号</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>凭证泄露 + 异地登录</td>\n<td>暗网监测命中 + 新地理位置</td>\n<td>高置信度账户接管</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备合规下降 + 数据外泄</td>\n<td>EDR 报告异常进程 + 大量下载</td>\n<td>高置信度终端感染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MFA 疲劳 + 登录成功</td>\n<td>短时间多次 MFA 推送 + 最终通过</td>\n<td>MFA Fatigue 攻击成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限提升 + 横向移动</td>\n<td>异常权限请求 + 访问新资源</td>\n<td>攻击者扩展控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>MITRE ATT&amp;CK 映射</strong>：将检测到的异常行为映射到 ATT&amp;CK 框架的战术/技术，帮助 SOC 团队理解攻击者处于攻击链的哪个阶段，从而决定响应优先级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化响应编排-soar\">自动化响应编排（SOAR）</h2><p>高置信度异常触发 SOAR Playbook 自动执行预定义的响应动作：</p>\n<p><strong>响应级别梯度</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>置信度</th>\n<th>响应动作</th>\n<th>用户影响</th>\n<th>自动/人工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低 (0.3-0.5)</td>\n<td>增强日志采集 + 通知 SOC</td>\n<td>无感知</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中 (0.5-0.7)</td>\n<td>步进验证（要求 MFA 重认证）</td>\n<td>轻度中断</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高 (0.7-0.9)</td>\n<td>降级会话权限 + SOC 调查</td>\n<td>中度限制</td>\n<td>自动 + 人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极高 (&gt;0.9)</td>\n<td>撤销会话 + 隔离设备 + 封禁</td>\n<td>完全阻断</td>\n<td>自动（事后复核）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Playbook 设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自动响应必须可逆——误报时能快速恢复用户访问</li>\n<li>每个自动动作必须生成审计记录</li>\n<li>高破坏性动作（账户禁用、设备擦除）需要人工确认</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与策略引擎的实时反馈\">与策略引擎的实时反馈</h2><p>持续监控的最终目的是影响访问决策。检测到的风险信号需要实时更新策略引擎的输入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{realtime}(t) = R_{static} + \\Delta R_{ueba}(t) + \\Delta R_{threat}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{static}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基于身份和设备的静态风险评分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta R_{ueba}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 UEBA 引擎在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的动态风险增量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta R_{threat}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是威胁检测的实时信号。</p>\n<p>实现机制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>UEBA 引擎通过事件流（Kafka/NATS）将风险评分变更推送给策略引擎</li>\n<li>策略引擎在下次评估同一用户的请求时使用更新后的风险分数</li>\n<li>高风险事件触发主动会话重评估——不等用户发新请求，直接撤销或降级已有会话</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"日志架构与数据治理\">日志架构与数据治理</h2><p>持续监控依赖全量、标准化、可检索的日志基础设施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>采集覆盖</strong>：所有访问决策日志（允许+拒绝）、认证事件、设备态势变更、网络流量元数据</li>\n<li><strong>标准化格式</strong>：统一为 OCSF（Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework）或 ECS（Elastic Common Schema）</li>\n<li><strong>热/温/冷分层</strong>：7 天热数据（即时查询）、90 天温数据（小时级检索）、365 天冷数据（合规保留）</li>\n<li><strong>不可篡改</strong>：日志写入后通过 WORM 存储或区块链锚定防止删改</li>\n<li><strong>隐私合规</strong>：日志中的 PII 做伪匿名化处理，遵循 GDPR 数据最小化原则</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持续验证闭环是零信任与传统安全的本质区别——&quot;放行但持续观察&quot;</li>\n<li>UEBA 通过行为基线检测不可能旅行、数据外泄、横向移动等异常</li>\n<li>多信号关联提升检测置信度，减少单一信号的误报率</li>\n<li>SOAR 按置信度分级自动响应，高破坏性动作保留人工确认</li>\n<li>检测结果实时反馈策略引擎，动态影响后续所有访问决策</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"maturity-model\">零信任成熟度模型</a>——如何度量持续监控能力的成熟度等级</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../service-mesh/operations/observability-integration\">可观测性集成实践</a>——Service Mesh 可观测性如何为零信任持续监控提供网络层信号</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"持续监控与行为分析","id":"持续监控与行为分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"UEBA 行为基线建模","id":"ueba-行为基线建模"},{"level":2,"text":"威胁检测与信号关联","id":"威胁检测与信号关联"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化响应编排（SOAR）","id":"自动化响应编排-soar"},{"level":2,"text":"与策略引擎的实时反馈","id":"与策略引擎的实时反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"日志架构与数据治理","id":"日志架构与数据治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"SASE 架构与网安融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/sase-convergence"},"next":{"title":"零信任成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/maturity-model"}}